ext-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">Updates on your terms</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">Daily, or pin a version.</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="topic-tab-models" aria-controls="topic-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">Any model, set where you need it</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">Your keys, your plan, your endpoint.</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="topic-tab-files" aria-controls="topic-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">Your company is a repository</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">Clone it, download it, keep it.</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="topic-tab-secrets" aria-controls="topic-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">Secret values stay out of git</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">Names in the repo, values encrypted.</p></button></div></div><div role="tabpanel" id="topic-panel" aria-labelledby="topic-tab-where" class="bg-card flex items-center justify-center border-t p-6 sm:p-8 lg:border-t-0 lg:border-l lg:p-12"><div class="animate-in fade-in duration-slower flex w-full max-w-xl min-w-0 flex-col gap-8 ease-out"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><h3 class="text-foreground text-xl font-medium tracking-tight">What runs where</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground text-base text-pretty">Self-hosting puts the web app, the API, the LLM gateway and the database on your server.</p><p class="text-muted-foreground text-base text-pretty">Sessions and Drive still run on Platinum sandboxes. They call back to your instance, so it must be reachable from the internet.</p></div><table class="bg-background w-full table-fixed border-separate border-spacing-0 rounded-lg border text-left text-sm"><caption class="sr-only">What runs where</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col" class="w-5/12 border-b p-3 font-normal"><span class="sr-only">Part</span></th><th scope="col" class="border-b p-3 font-normal text-muted-foreground font-mono text-xs tracking-wide uppercase">Kortix Cloud</th><th scope="col" class="border-b p-3 font-normal text-muted-foreground font-mono text-xs tracking-wide uppercase">Self-hosted</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row" class="text-foreground p-3 align-top font-medium border-b">Web app, API, LLM gateway</th><td class="text-muted-foreground p-3 align-top border-b">Kortix</td><td class="text-foreground p-3 align-top border-b">Your server</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="text-foreground p-3 align-top font-medium border-b">Database and file storage</th><td class="text-muted-foreground p-3 align-top border-b">Kortix</td><td class="text-foreground p-3 align-top border-b">Your server</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="text-foreground p-3 align-top font-medium border-b">Accounts, secrets, audit log</th><td class="text-muted-foreground p-3 align-top border-b">Kortix</td><td class="text-foreground p-3 align-top border-b">Your server</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="text-foreground p-3 align-top font-medium border-b">Sessions</th><td class="text-muted-foreground p-3 align-top border-b">Platinum</td><td class="text-foreground p-3 align-top border-b">Platinum</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="text-foreground p-3 align-top font-medium border-b">Drive</th><td class="text-muted-foreground p-3 align-top border-b">Platinum</td><td class="text-foreground p-3 align-top border-b">Platinum</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="text-foreground p-3 align-top font-medium ">Models</th><td class="text-muted-foreground p-3 align-top ">Managed or yours</td><td class="text-foreground p-3 align-top ">Yours</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></section>"`;

exports[`shipped marketing route composition self-hosted renders its topic tabs section unchanged 1`] = `"<section id="how-it-works" class="scroll-mt-16 py-14 lg:py-20"><div class="kx-rail-fade relative border-y px-4 lg:px-17"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="px-4 py-12 lg:px-11 lg:py-16 lg:pr-12"><h2 class="text-foreground text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-balance md:text-2xl lg:text-3xl">How self-hosting works.<span class="text-muted-foreground block">From the first command to the daily update.</span></h2><div role="tablist" aria-label="How self-hosting works" aria-orientation="vertical" class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-6"><button type="button" role="tab" id="selfhost-tab-where" aria-controls="selfhost-panel" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">What runs where</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">Your server, and Platinum.</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="selfhost-tab-reach" aria-controls="selfhost-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">Reachability</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">A domain, or a tunnel to evaluate.</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="selfhost-tab-setup" aria-controls="selfhost-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">First sign-in</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">Six steps in the web app.</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="selfhost-tab-updates" aria-controls="selfhost-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">Updates and versions</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">Daily, or pinned.</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="selfhost-tab-enterprise" aria-controls="selfhost-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">Enterprise on your server</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">One flag, every account.</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="selfhost-tab-needs" aria-controls="selfhost-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">Requirements</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">What the server needs.</p></button></div></div><div role="tabpanel" id="selfhost-panel" aria-labelledby="selfhost-tab-where" class="bg-card flex items-center justify-center border-t p-6 sm:p-8 lg:border-t-0 lg:border-l lg:p-12"><div class="animate-in fade-in duration-slower flex w-full max-w-xl min-w-0 flex-col gap-8 ease-out"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><h3 class="text-foreground text-xl font-medium tracking-tight">What runs where</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground text-base text-pretty">init writes one Docker Compose project. Every service in it runs on your server.</p><p class="text-muted-foreground text-base text-pretty">Sessions and Drive run on Platinum sandboxes. They call back to your instance.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-6"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><span class="text-muted-foreground font-mono text-xs tracking-wide uppercase">Your server</span><ul class="bg-background flex flex-col divide-y rounded-lg border"><li class="flex flex-col gap-1 px-4 py-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between sm:gap-6"><code class="text-foreground font-mono text-sm">frontend</code><span class="text-muted-foreground text-sm text-pretty sm:text-right">The web app</span></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-1 px-4 py-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between sm:gap-6"><code class="text-foreground font-mono text-sm">kortix-api</code><span class="text-muted-foreground text-sm text-pretty sm:text-right">The REST API</span></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-1 px-4 py-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between sm:gap-6"><code class="text-foreground font-mono text-sm">llm-gateway</code><span class="text-muted-foreground text-sm text-pretty sm:text-right">The LLM gateway</span></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-1 px-4 py-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between sm:gap-6"><code class="text-foreground font-mono text-sm">supabase-*</code><span class="text-muted-foreground text-sm text-pretty sm:text-right">Postgres, auth and file storage</span></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-1 px-4 py-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between sm:gap-6"><code class="text-foreground font-mono text-sm">kortix-updater</code><span class="text-muted-foreground text-sm text-pretty sm:text-right">Pulls, migrates and rolls daily</span></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-1 px-4 py-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between sm:gap-6"><code class="text-foreground font-mono text-sm">caddy</code><span class="text-muted-foreground text-sm text-pretty sm:text-right">TLS on 80 and 443, domain mode</span></li></ul></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><span class="text-muted-foreground font-mono text-xs tracking-wide uppercase">Platinum</span><ul class="bg-background flex flex-col divide-y rounded-lg border"><li class="flex flex-col gap-1 px-4 py-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between sm:gap-6"><code class="text-foreground font-mono text-sm">Sessions</code><span class="text-muted-foreground text-sm text-pretty sm:text-right">One sandbox per session</span></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-1 px-4 py-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between sm:gap-6"><code class="text-foreground font-mono text-sm">Drive</code><span class="text-muted-foreground text-sm text-pretty sm:text-right">Platinum volumes</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>"`;

exports[`shipped marketing route composition framework renders its topic tabs section unchanged 1`] = `"<section id="how-it-works" class="scroll-mt-16 py-14 lg:py-20"><div class="kx-rail-fade relative border-y px-4 lg:px-17"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="px-4 py-12 lg:px-11 lg:py-16 lg:pr-12"><h2 class="text-foreground text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-balance md:text-2xl lg:text-3xl">How it works.<span class="text-muted-foreground block">One part at a time.</span></h2><div role="tablist" aria-label="How the Kortix framework works" aria-orientation="vertical" class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-6"><button type="button" role="tab" id="framework-tab-agents" aria-controls="framework-panel" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">Agents</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">One block in kortix.yaml and one prompt file.</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="framework-tab-extensions" aria-controls="framework-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">pi extensions</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">Extend the harness with TypeScript.</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="framework-tab-rules" aria-controls="framework-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">Rules</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">Allow, Ask or Block, per tool and per app call.</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="framework-tab-triggers" aria-controls="framework-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">Triggers, 24/7</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">A schedule or a webhook starts the agent.</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="framework-tab-computer" aria-controls="framework-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">A computer per session</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">pi runs the agent on its own cloud computer.</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="framework-tab-review" aria-controls="framework-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">Changes through review</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">Work reaches main through a change request.</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="framework-tab-build" aria-controls="framework-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">Build your own experience</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">@kortix/sdk and @kortix/ui on the same backend.</p></button></div></div><div role="tabpanel" id="framework-panel" aria-labelledby="framework-tab-agents" class="bg-card flex items-center justify-center border-t p-6 sm:p-8 lg:border-t-0 lg:border-l lg:p-12"><div class="animate-in fade-in duration-slower flex w-full max-w-xl min-w-0 flex-col gap-8 ease-out"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><h3 class="text-foreground text-xl font-medium tracking-tight">Agents</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground text-base text-pretty">An agent is a block in kortix.yaml and a Markdown prompt. The block names its model, tools, connectors and skills.</p><p class="text-muted-foreground text-base text-pretty">Access is deny-by-default. An agent gets no connector, secret or skill the block does not list.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="bg-background flex min-w-0 flex-col rounded-lg border"><p class="text-muted-foreground border-b px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">kortix.yaml</p><pre class="text-foreground overflow-x-auto px-5 py-4 font-mono text-xs leading-6"><code><span class="block leading-6 break-words whitespace-pre-wrap lg:min-w-max lg:whitespace-pre"><span class="text-muted-foreground">  # Marketing</span></span><span class="block leading-6 break-words whitespace-pre-wrap lg:min-w-max lg:whitespace-pre"><span class="text-muted-foreground">  </span><span class="text-foreground">marketing</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">:</span></span><span class="block leading-6 break-words whitespace-pre-wrap lg:min-w-max lg:whitespace-pre"><span class="text-muted-foreground">    </span><span class="text-foreground">description</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">:</span> <span class="text-kortix-green">Drafts LinkedIn posts from shipped work.</span></span><span class="block leading-6 break-words whitespace-pre-wrap lg:min-w-max lg:whitespace-pre"><span class="text-muted-foreground">    </span><span class="text-foreground">prompt_file</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">:</span> <span class="text-kortix-green">agents/marketing/content.md</span></span><span class="block leading-6 break-words whitespace-pre-wrap lg:min-w-max lg:whitespace-pre"><span class="text-muted-foreground">    </span><span class="text-foreground">tools</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">:</span><span class="text-muted-foreground"> [read, web_search]</span></span><span class="block leading-6 break-words whitespace-pre-wrap lg:min-w-max lg:whitespace-pre"><span class="text-muted-foreground">    </span><span class="text-foreground">connectors</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">:</span><span class="text-muted-foreground"> [linkedin, kortix_slack]</span></span><span class="block leading-6 break-words whitespace-pre-wrap lg:min-w-max lg:whitespace-pre"><span class="text-muted-foreground">    </span><span class="text-foreground">skills</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">:</span><span class="text-muted-foreground"> [write-post]</span></span><span class="block leading-6 break-words whitespace-pre-wrap lg:min-w-max lg:whitespace-pre"><span class="text-muted-foreground">    </span><span class="text-foreground">commands</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">:</span><span class="text-muted-foreground"> [draft-post]</span></span><span class="block leading-6 break-words whitespace-pre-wrap lg:min-w-max lg:whitespace-pre"><span class="text-muted-foreground">    </span><span class="text-foreground">extensions</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">:</span><span class="text-muted-foreground"> [web-access]</span></span></code></pre></div><div class="bg-background flex min-w-0 flex-col rounded-lg border"><p class="text-muted-foreground border-b px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">agents/marketing/content.md</p><pre class="text-foreground overflow-x-auto px-5 py-4 font-mono text-xs leading-6"><code><span class="block leading-6 break-words whitespace-pre-wrap lg:min-w-max lg:whitespace-pre">You write Arcadia LinkedIn posts from work the team shipped.</span><span class="block leading-6 break-words whitespace-pre-wrap lg:min-w-max lg:whitespace-pre">Follow the write-post skill and the tone in the company memory.</span><span class="block leading-6 break-words whitespace-pre-wrap lg:min-w-max lg:whitespace-pre">Every post waits for a person to approve it.</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>"`;

exports[`shipped marketing route composition multiplayer renders its topic tabs section unchanged 1`] = `"<section id="how-it-works" class="scroll-mt-16 py-14 lg:py-20"><div class="kx-rail-fade relative border-y px-4 lg:px-17"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="px-4 py-12 lg:px-11 lg:py-16 lg:pr-12"><h2 class="text-foreground text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-balance md:text-2xl lg:text-3xl">How it works.<span class="text-muted-foreground block">From one person to the whole team.</span></h2><div role="tablist" aria-label="How multiplayer works" aria-orientation="vertical" class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-6"><button type="button" role="tab" id="team-tab-share" aria-controls="team-panel" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">Share a session</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">Private by default. The owner opens it up.</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="team-tab-together" aria-controls="team-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">Work in it together</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">Everyone with access reads it and continues it.</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="team-tab-channels" aria-controls="team-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">Slack and Microsoft Teams</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">Mention the bot. The agent replies in the thread.</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="team-tab-access" aria-controls="team-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">Who may run which agent</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">Roles per workspace and resource, agents per person.</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="team-tab-approve" aria-controls="team-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">People approve</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">You decide what an agent does without a person.</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="team-tab-personal" aria-controls="team-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">Personal stays personal</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">Your own accounts reach only your private sessions.</p></button></div></div><div role="tabpanel" id="team-panel" aria-labelledby="team-tab-share" class="bg-card flex items-center justify-center border-t p-6 sm:p-8 lg:border-t-0 lg:border-l lg:p-12"><div class="animate-in fade-in duration-slower flex w-full max-w-xl min-w-0 flex-col gap-8 ease-out"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><h3 class="text-foreground text-xl font-medium tracking-tight">Share a session</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground text-base text-pretty">A session is private to the person who started it. The owner can open it to chosen people and groups, or to the whole project.</p><p class="text-muted-foreground text-base text-pretty">A public link shows it read-only to anyone with the link. Revoke it at any time.</p></div><div class="bg-background flex flex-col rounded-lg border"><ul class="flex flex-col divide-y"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 flex size-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border"></span><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-1"><p class="text-foreground text-base">Only you</p><p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">The owner. This is the default.</p></div></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 flex size-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-foreground"><span class="bg-foreground size-2 rounded-full"></span></span><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-1"><p class="text-foreground text-base font-medium">Specific people</p><p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">The owner, plus the members and groups they pick.</p><ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-1.5"><li class="bg-muted text-foreground rounded-md px-2.5 py-1 text-sm">Member 2</li><li class="bg-muted text-foreground rounded-md px-2.5 py-1 text-sm">Finance</li></ul></div></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 flex size-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border"></span><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-1"><p class="text-foreground text-base">Whole workspace</p><p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">Every member of the project.</p></div></li></ul><p class="text-muted-foreground flex items-center gap-2 border-t p-4 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="size-4 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M165.66,90.34a8,8,0,0,1,0,11.32l-64,64a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32l64-64A8,8,0,0,1,165.66,90.34ZM215.6,40.4a56,56,0,0,0-79.2,0L106.34,70.45a8,8,0,0,0,11.32,11.32l30.06-30a40,40,0,0,1,56.57,56.56l-30.07,30.06a8,8,0,0,0,11.31,11.32L215.6,119.6a56,56,0,0,0,0-79.2ZM138.34,174.22l-30.06,30.06a40,40,0,1,1-56.56-56.57l30.05-30.05a8,8,0,0,0-11.32-11.32L40.4,136.4a56,56,0,0,0,79.2,79.2l30.06-30.07a8,8,0,0,0-11.32-11.31Z"></path></svg>Public link: read-only, no sign-in.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>"`;

exports[`shipped marketing route composition security renders its topic tabs section unchanged 1`] = `"<section id="how-it-works" class="scroll-mt-16 py-14 lg:py-20"><div class="kx-rail-fade relative border-y px-4 lg:px-17"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="px-4 py-12 lg:px-11 lg:py-16 lg:pr-12"><h2 class="text-foreground text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-balance md:text-2xl lg:text-3xl">How it works.<span class="text-muted-foreground block">One layer at a time.</span></h2><div role="tablist" aria-label="Layers of the security model" aria-orientation="vertical" class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-6"><button type="button" role="tab" id="layer-tab-identity" aria-controls="layer-panel" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">Identity and roles</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">Who may open a workspace, and which agents they may run.</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="layer-tab-agent" aria-controls="layer-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">Agent permissions</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">An agent acts as itself, with only what you grant.</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="layer-tab-computer" aria-controls="layer-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">The computer and egress</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">Each session gets its own isolated cloud computer.</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="layer-tab-connectors" aria-controls="layer-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">Connectors and approvals</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">Kortix holds the login and decides each call.</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="layer-tab-secrets" aria-controls="layer-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">Secrets</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">Encrypted per workspace, delivered only where allowed.</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="layer-tab-models" aria-controls="layer-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">Models</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">Every model request passes one gateway.</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="layer-tab-changes" aria-controls="layer-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">Changes and review</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">Work reaches main through a change request.</p></button></div></div><div role="tabpanel" id="layer-panel" aria-labelledby="layer-tab-identity" class="bg-card flex items-center justify-center border-t p-6 sm:p-8 lg:border-t-0 lg:border-l lg:p-12"><div class="animate-in fade-in duration-slower flex w-full max-w-xl min-w-0 flex-col gap-8 ease-out"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><h3 class="text-foreground text-xl font-medium tracking-tight">Identity and roles</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground text-base text-pretty">People sign in with SAML single sign-on, or a password with two-factor.</p><p class="text-muted-foreground text-base text-pretty">Each person holds an account role and a role in each project. Groups grant a project to many people at once.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-6"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><span class="text-muted-foreground font-mono text-xs tracking-wide uppercase">Workspace role</span><ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5"><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="bg-background text-foreground rounded-md border px-3 py-1.5 text-base">Owner</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="text-muted-foreground size-3.5"><path d="M181.66,133.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L164.69,128,90.34,53.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l80,80A8,8,0,0,1,181.66,133.66Z"></path></svg></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="bg-background text-foreground rounded-md border px-3 py-1.5 text-base">Admin</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="text-muted-foreground size-3.5"><path d="M181.66,133.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L164.69,128,90.34,53.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l80,80A8,8,0,0,1,181.66,133.66Z"></path></svg></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="bg-background text-foreground rounded-md border px-3 py-1.5 text-base">Member</span></li></ol></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><span class="text-muted-foreground font-mono text-xs tracking-wide uppercase">Access role</span><ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5"><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="bg-background text-foreground rounded-md border px-3 py-1.5 text-base">Manager</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="text-muted-foreground size-3.5"><path d="M181.66,133.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L164.69,128,90.34,53.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l80,80A8,8,0,0,1,181.66,133.66Z"></path></svg></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="bg-background text-foreground rounded-md border px-3 py-1.5 text-base">Member</span></li></ol></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><span class="text-muted-foreground font-mono text-xs tracking-wide uppercase">Sign-in</span><ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5"><li class="bg-muted text-foreground rounded-md px-2.5 py-1 text-sm">SAML 2.0 SSO</li><li class="bg-muted text-foreground rounded-md px-2.5 py-1 text-sm">SCIM 2.0</li><li class="bg-muted text-foreground rounded-md px-2.5 py-1 text-sm">Two-factor</li><li class="bg-muted text-foreground rounded-md px-2.5 py-1 text-sm">Session timeout</li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>"`;
